\begin{frame}
\frametitle{Хэш-таблица}
\framesubtitle{Метод открытой адресации}


Many improved versions have been studied. \newline

\textcolor{blue}{Two-probe hashing} [ separate-chaining variant ] \newline
Hash to two positions, insert key in shorter of the two chains. \newline

\textcolor{blue}{Double hashing} [ linear-probing variant ] \newline
Use linear probing, but skip a variable amount, not just 1 each time. \newline
Effectively eliminates clustering. \newline

\textcolor{blue}{Cuckoo hashing} [ linear-probing variant ] \newline
Hash key to two positions; insert key into either position; if occupied, reinsert displaced key into its alternative position. 


\end{frame}

